OL,3,GNEWSAI climbed the career ladder and
OL,4,Agot my dream job at 30 - then I hit
OL,5,Aburnout
OL,6,
OL,7,FJo Hooper spent her 20s trying to climb
OL,8,Fthe career ladder, quickly rising
OL,9,Fthrough the ranks with promotions and
OL,10,Fpay rises.
OL,12,F"I loved being good at it," said Jo, a
OL,13,Fformer communications professional.
OL,15,FBut just after she landed her dream
OL,16,Frole at 30, Jo struggled with burnout
OL,17,Fand had to take time off work.
OL,19,FBurnout is recognised by the World
OL,20,FHealth Organization (WHO) as a state of
OL,21,Fphysical and emotional exhaustion.
